<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδά̆τ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a little water, rivulet,</i>
			of the Ilissus, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				229a
			</span></i>, cf. Pap. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				40.546
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				229b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				606b21
			</span></i>; <i>runnels,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				81.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>small rain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.9.9
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>a small drink of water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.105
			</span></i>; <i>a small quantity of water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
